Mods: {
	CalamityLegendsComeBack: {
		Items: {
			Weapons: {
				NewLegendYharimsCrystal: {
					// DisplayName: Sovereign Above All - Yharim's Crystal
					// Tooltip: "[GFB]"
					/* TooltipBody:
						'''
						[c/F8E28A:Left Click]: Hold to whirl the crystal into a high-speed spinning golden disc that shreds nearby enemies; after each full revolution the blade eases to a stop and re-aims toward your cursor.
						Striking enemies bursts out homing gold-flame fireballs and burning shards that orbit targets, scorch them, and detonate in holy fire.
						[c/73DFFF:Right Click]: Hold to summon six golden escort warships into an air-defense formation while the crystal itself vents an unending scorching main laser.
						Clicking left during the barrage unleashes a coordinated heavy strike: the main laser instantly thickens, sprays golden bolts to both sides, fans out splitting lasers, and the fleet volleys twin gold bombs before briefly powering down.
						[c/F6D06B:Auric Ultimate]: With full energy and the Legendary Emblem equipped, press the [Legendary Skill Key] to unleash one of two ultimates:
						[c/F6D06B:- Sacred Flame Blade (blade form)]: swing a colossal sacred blade that tears through space and raises sky-piercing pillars of golden fire.
						[c/F6D06B:- Laser Storm (crystal form)]: deploy twelve gold-sheened laser ships above the target, weaving an all-destroying storm of deathrays.
						''' */
					// CurrentMode: "[c/F6D06B:Current core] {0}"
					// Mode_Drill: "[c/F2B85D:Siege Drill]"
					// Mode_Flamethrower: "[c/FF7A45:Auric Flamethrower]"
					// Mode_Warships: "[c/73DFFF:Imperial Fleet]"
					// Mode_HelixLaser: "[c/F8E28A:Helix Prism]"
					// Mode_Drill_Desc: "[c/F2B85D:Siege Drill] [c/DCD6C8:spins up into a narrow sawline, chewing close targets and shaking the screen on impact.]"
					// Mode_Flamethrower_Desc: "[c/FF7A45:Auric Flamethrower] [c/DCD6C8:vents, then fires rapid energy-flame pseudo-lasers with light homing before resting.]"
					// Mode_Warships_Desc: "[c/73DFFF:Imperial Fleet] [c/DCD6C8:deploys 6 escorts, 4 cruisers, 2 artillery ships, 1 forward super-laser ship, and 1 rear repair ship.]"
					// Mode_HelixLaser_Desc: "[c/F8E28A:Helix Prism] [c/DCD6C8:weaves helix beams, refraction needles, and short golden lances; hold right click while firing to smoothly focus them into one point.]"
					// SwitchInfo: "[c/B5E7FF:Switch] [c/DCD6C8:right click the left side of the player to cycle backward, or the right side to cycle forward.]"
					// FocusInfo: "[c/F8E28A:Focus] [c/DCD6C8:only works while the Helix Prism is firing, and converges with acceleration instead of snapping.]"
					// PrismReworkInfo: "[c/F8E28A:Left Click] [c/DCD6C8:hold to deploy six inertial prisms; their helper beams converge into a continuous destruction ray fired from the crystal.]"
					// RightCommandInfo: "[c/73DFFF:Right Array] [c/DCD6C8:deploy six golden drones into an air-defense battery: the front pair fire fast auric needles, the middle pair weave curving crossfire, and the rear pair launch tracking hearts that grow faster and sharper over time. While holding left click, every round and the main beam lock directly onto your cursor; the command also volleys twin gold bombs before a 2-second shutdown.]"
					// ResetInfo: "[c/FF7A45:Reset] [c/DCD6C8:releasing left click, dying, or running out of mana clears the entire sequence.]"
					// EXInfo: "[c/F6D06B:Legendary Skill (Laser Storm)] [c/DCD6C8:summon 12 golden laser ships into orbit. Left click when they are ready to fire.]"
					// LegendaryHint: "[c/BABABA:Hold Shift to access the record]"
					/* LegendaryText:
						'''
						[c/E6C024:The first Tyrant Crystal was closer to a golden prism: refract the beam, gather the energy, then fire ruin forward.]
						[c/E6C024:But if it is written only as distant fleets or generic imperial technology, it drifts farther from the Tyrant, auric power, and dragonflame.]
						[c/E6C024:After the rebuild, the left-click beams are no longer just a matter of quantity. Between spreading and converging, they keep closing in on the true focus.]
						[c/E6C024:The burst structure released by right click feels like overloaded crystal energy being split out early, forcing the battlefield through repeated calibration.]
						[c/E6C024:When the final stage opens, the prism no longer searches for brighter light. It waits for the Tyrant's will to press every ray into one command.]
						''' */
				}
			}

